{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Ruddy.</b> It is a sign that he would shed blood (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>All of him like a hairy mantle.</b> Full of hair like a woolen mantle that is full of hair — פלוקי״דא בְּלַעַ״ז." "<b>And they called his name Esau.</b> Everyone called him so, because he was made and fully formed with hair like a child of many years."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {1 "The la'az is Old French peluche, 'shaggy fabric' or 'fleece'."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:30.325563198Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}